    "diagnosis": "CNS lymphomatoid granulomatosis, grade&nbsp;3",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "CD3 staining. Many CD3+ T&nbsp;cells contribute to an intracerebral lesion of lymphomatoid granulomatosis, grade&nbsp;3, which shows extensive brain tissue necrosis.",
